tools.example:
Application Library: Fuel_Cell_and_Electrolyzer_Module/Fuel_Cells/sofc_unit_cell and sofc_nh3 (ammonia-fed SOFC with Reaction Sources).
model.component("comp1").physics().create("fc", "HydrogenFuelCell", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").prop("DefaultElectrodeReactionSettings").set("ChargeCarryingIon", "Oxide");
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").prop("DefaultElectrodeReactionSettings").set("TRHE", "700[degC]");

Application Library: Fuel_Cell_and_Electrolyzer_Module/Electrolyzers/soec and soec_co2 (co-electrolysis with water gas shift).
model.component("comp1").physics().create("we", "WaterElectrolyzer", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("we").prop("DefaultElectrodeReactionSettings").set("ChargeCarryingIon", "Oxide");

Application Library: Fuel_Cell_and_Electrolyzer_Module/Fuel_Cells/nonisothermal_pem_fuel_cell (current collectors with cooling) and Electrolyzers/alkaline_electrolyzer (separator).
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").create("cc1", "CurrentCollector", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").feature("cc1").set("sigmas_mat", "from_mat");

Application Library: Fuel_Cell_and_Electrolyzer_Module/Electrolyzers/alkaline_electrolyzer and aec_shunt_currents (Internal H2/O2 Electrode Surface).
model.component("comp1").physics("we").create("h2es1", "H2ElectrodeSurface", 1);
model.component("comp1").physics("we").create("o2es1", "O2ElectrodeSurface", 1);

Application Library: Fuel_Cell_and_Electrolyzer_Module/Fuel_Cells/fuel_cell_cathode_with_liquid_water (liquid saturation from Phase Transport in Porous Media).
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").feature("o2gasph1").create("wce1", "WaterCondensationEvaporation", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("fc").feature("o2gasph1").feature("wce1").set("k_ce", "kce");

Application Library: Corrosion_Module/Atmospheric_Corrosion/act_scratched_galvanized_steel (zinc ampholyte, fully dissociated ions and carbonic acid).
model.component("comp1").physics("aqt").feature("el1").create("amph1", "Ampholyte", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("aqt").feature("el1").create("wa1", "WeakAcid", 2);

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module/Tutorials/resistive_wafer (terminal effect on a thin seed layer) and fountain_flow.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("els", "ElectrodeShell", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("els").feature("ece1").set("s", "s_init");

Application Library: Electrochemistry_Module/Tutorials/cyclic_voltammetry_1d and Electroanalysis/microdisk_voltammetry.
model.component("comp1").physics("tcd").feature("es1").set("BoundaryCondition", "CyclicVoltammetry");
model.component("comp1").physics("tcd").feature("es1").set("sweeprate", "v");
model.component("comp1").physics("tcd").feature("es1").set("Evertex1", "E_vertex1");
model.component("comp1").physics("tcd").feature("es1").set("Evertex2", "E_vertex2");
model.study().create("std1");
model.study("std1").create("cyclv", "CyclicVoltammetry");
